### KYC Service - manual requests (VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains HTTP client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here
@refreshToken = paste-refresh-token-here

### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "Sup3rSecret!", "fullName": "Alice Nguyen" }

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "Sup3rSecret!" }

### Refresh (rotates the refresh token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### Me
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- KYC

### Current application (status + details + documents + history)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kyc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Status only (polling)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kyc/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Save draft / resume point
PUT {{baseUrl}}/kyc/draft
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Alice Nguyen",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-20",
  "nationality": "VN",
  "currentStep": "PERSONAL_INFO"
}

### Upload a document through the API (multipart). type: id-front | id-back | selfie
POST {{baseUrl}}/kyc/documents/id-front
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="id-front.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./samples/id-front.jpg
--boundary--

### Direct upload step 1: get a presigned PUT URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/kyc/documents/selfie/upload-url
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contentType": "image/jpeg", "contentLength": 123456 }

### Direct upload step 2: PUT the bytes to data.upload.url with data.upload.headers, then confirm
POST {{baseUrl}}/kyc/documents/selfie/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "key": "paste data.upload.key here" }

### Fresh view URL for a document
GET {{baseUrl}}/kyc/documents/id-front
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Submit (JSON - images already uploaded)
POST {{baseUrl}}/kyc/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressLine1": "12 Nguyen Hue",
  "city": "Ho Chi Minh City",
  "country": "VN",
  "idType": "NATIONAL_ID",
  "idNumber": "079090001234",
  "idIssueDate": "2021-01-15",
  "idExpiryDate": "2031-01-15"
}

### DEV ONLY - force a decision immediately
POST {{baseUrl}}/kyc/dev/review
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decision": "REJECTED", "reason": "Selfie does not match the ID photo" }
